      "sequence": 19,
      "type": "constructed_response",
      "stem_html": "<section class=\"exam-shared-context\">三、非选择题：</section><br>9. 某同学要测量微安表内阻，可利用<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/physics/f97149abe551e6a68904.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\">实验器材有：电源E（电动势<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/physics/60c17aa1a311e80770bd.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\">，内阻很小），电流表（量程<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/physics/7edeb6415e0f2a20694d.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\">，内阻约<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/physics/1404f522264d45ac84b9.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\">），微安表（量程<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/physics/589fef30a445273f198d.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\">，内阻<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/physics/551ebb183b9b5fcd9c9f.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\">待测，约<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/physics/80205cac12c93de33cf0.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\">），滑动变阻器R（最大阻值），定值电阻<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/physics/23000e51fdc291196532.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\">（阻值），开关S，导线若干。<br><img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-figure-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/physics/a2a6ad6ec9cf78bfb0ec.png\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\"><br>（1）在答题卡上将图中所示的器材符号连线，画出实验电路原理图_____；<br>（2）某次测量中，微安表的示数为<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/physics/7b78911b5ead83ccb7fd.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\">，电流表的示数为<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/physics/3d8f9ab38ae131d5adc2.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\">，由此计算出微安表内阻<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/physics/c416d77f6dc620606a7d.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\">_____<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/physics/bbfbd79dded0c90a9632.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\">。",
